{"answer":null,"concept_id":"cudagraph-capture-failure-eager-fallback","content_sha256":"sha256:d69b3e8faee4a12c543b17ec624f42633d19135c076b117a21841b41ca0f111b","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789365708.1244318,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"故障演练落到 Graph。与 JIT warmup、设备侧 token 数题同一因果链。","id":"q-inference-cudagraph-capture-fail-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"动态 shape miss 档、JIT 核在捕获窗口编译、host 同步/打印、未注册自定义 op、token 数当 CPU 标量传入。失败后常静默退 eager，错误率为 0。应看 eager 比例和捕获错误计数，而不是只看 5xx"},{"id":"b","text":"一定是权重量化错了"},{"id":"c","text":"Graph 失败只影响日志，执行路径不变"},{"id":"d","text":"把 max-num-seqs 调到 1 就能强制 Graph 成功且吞吐更高"}],"prompt":"线上 decode 突然变慢、GPU 利用率锯齿，日志里 CUDA Graph 捕获失败或反复失效。优先查什么？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"vLLM documentation","url":"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"runtime","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
